## Preparation

- Preheat oven to 175 °C
- Grease a loaf pan
- Mash ripe bananas (about 3 medium = 1.5 cups)
. i would also ,like to chgange smth here

## Ingredients

- 1.5 cups mashed bananas (about 3 ripe)
- 1/3 cup melted butter
- 0.75 cup sugar
- 1 egg, beaten
- 1 tsp vanilla extract
- 1 tsp baking soda
- Pinch of salt
- 1.5 cups all-purpose flou
. i think this would be nice 

## Instructions

- Mash bananas in a bowl
- Stir melted butter into bananas
- Mix in sugar, egg, and vanilla
- Sprinkle baking soda and salt over mixture, mix well
- Add flour and stir until just combined (do not overmix)
- Pour batter into greased loaf pan

## Baking
- Bake 50–60 min at 350 °F (175 °C)
- Check with toothpick (should come out clean)
- Cool before slicing
